<style>
/* Night stage over the city, single theme by choice.
   Layout: header / [map | side panel] / time bar. Nothing floats over the map.
   Type scales with the screen: ~15px on a laptop, ~18px on a 1080p projector, 14px on phones. */
:root {
  --ink: #0b0e13;
  --panel: #12161d;
  --line: rgba(190, 204, 224, 0.15);
  --paper: #ece6da;
  --muted: #9aa3b1;
  --heat: #ee8a45;
  --sun: #ffd27a;
  --display: "Newsreader", "Iowan Old Style", "Palatino Linotype", Georgia, serif;
  --body: "IBM Plex Sans", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace;
  color-scheme: dark;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
html { font-size: clamp(14px, 0.42vw + 9.5px, 22px); height: 100%; }
body {
  margin: 0; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);
  font: 1rem/1.45 var(--body);
  display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 24rem;
  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
}
button { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--heat); outline-offset: 2px; }
.panel { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.4rem; min-height: 0; }
.eyebrow { font: 500 0.72rem/1.3 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
.btn { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.3rem; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.9rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--paper); white-space: nowrap; }
.btn:hover { border-color: rgba(236, 230, 218, 0.45); }
.btn.primary { background: var(--paper); color: #14161a; border-color: var(--paper); font-weight: 500; }
.seg { display: inline-flex; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.3rem; overflow: hidden; }
.seg button { background: transparent; border: 0; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; }
.seg button + button { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
.seg button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: rgba(236, 230, 218, 0.13); color: var(--paper); }
.tag { display: inline-block; font: 500 0.66rem/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 0.22rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 0.2rem; vertical-align: 0.1rem; white-space: nowrap; }
.tag.meas { background: rgba(110, 190, 145, 0.2); color: #a6e0bd; }
.tag.calc { background: rgba(255, 210, 122, 0.16); color: #ffd99a; }
.tag.model { background: rgba(238, 138, 69, 0.18); color: #f5b88c; }

/* header */
#top { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem; }
#top .brand { display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-right: auto; }
#top .brand b { font: 500 1.25rem/1.1 var(--display); }

/* map column */
#mapCol { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; min-height: 0; }
#mapBar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 0.35rem 0.7rem; font-size: 0.88rem; }
#mapBar .what { font-weight: 500; }
#mapBar .when { color: var(--muted); }
#aqi { margin-left: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem; border-radius: 0.3rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; }
#stageWrap { position: relative; flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
#stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; cursor: grab; }
#stage:active { cursor: grabbing; }
#labels { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; }
.lm { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; font: 0.74rem var(--mono); color: #fff4d6; white-space: nowrap; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px #000, 0 0 8px #000; }
.lm i { display: inline-block; width: 0.42rem; height: 0.42rem; border: 1px solid #fff4d6; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0.35rem 0 -0.2rem; }
#sunLabel, #northLabel, #lidLabel { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; font: 500 0.8rem var(--mono); white-space: nowrap; pointer-events: none; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px #000, 0 0 8px #000; }
#sunLabel { color: var(--sun); }
#northLabel { color: #dfe5ee; }
#lidLabel { color: #e6dccb; margin-top: -1.3rem; }
#tip { position: fixed; z-index: 30; pointer-events: none; background: rgba(10, 12, 16, 0.96); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.3rem; padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem; font-size: 0.82rem; max-width: 18rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
#tip .s { color: var(--muted); }

/* side panel */
#side { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; overflow-y: auto; padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
.sec { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.45rem; }
.sec + .sec { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 0.9rem; }
.layers { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.15rem; }
.layers button { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; text-align: left; background: transparent; border: 0; border-left: 3px solid transparent; padding: 0.4rem 0.55rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; }
.layers button[aria-pressed="true"] { color: var(--paper); border-left-color: var(--heat); background: rgba(236, 230, 218, 0.06); }
.layers button:disabled { opacity: 0.35; cursor: not-allowed; }
.lg-bar { height: 0.7rem; border-radius: 0.15rem; }
.lg-ticks { position: relative; height: 1rem; font: 0.72rem var(--mono); color: var(--muted); }
.lg-ticks span { position: absolute; top: 0; transform: translateX(-50%); white-space: nowrap; }
.lg-ticks span:first-child { transform: none; }
.lg-ticks span:last-child { transform: translateX(-100%); }
.lg-note { font-size: 0.86rem; color: #c3c9d2; margin: 0; }
.key { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 0.1rem 0.6rem; padding: 0.5rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.key:first-child { border-top: 0; }
.key .k { font-size: 0.9rem; }
.key .v { font: 500 1.15rem/1.1 var(--display); text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.key .s { grid-column: 1 / -1; font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--muted); }
.src-list { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #c3c9d2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.35rem; }
.src-list b { color: var(--paper); font-weight: 500; }
#whatStatus { font-size: 0.86rem; color: #c3c9d2; margin: 0; }
#whatStatus b { color: var(--paper); font-weight: 500; }

/* walkthrough (top of the side panel) */
#tourBox { display: none; }
body.touring #tourBox { display: flex; }
#capEye { color: var(--heat); }
#capText { font: 400 1.22rem/1.4 var(--display); margin: 0; }
.capnav { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; align-items: center; }
#tourCount { font: 0.78rem var(--mono); color: var(--muted); margin-right: auto; }
#yearChart { width: 100%; height: 9rem; display: block; }
.yk { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.2rem 0.8rem; font: 0.72rem var(--mono); color: var(--muted); }
.yk i { display: inline-block; width: 0.7rem; height: 0.2rem; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 0.3rem; }

/* building brief */
.bf-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.6rem; align-items: flex-start; }
.bf-title { font: 500 1.15rem/1.15 var(--display); }
.bf-meta { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }
.bf-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.5rem; }
.bf-grid div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.1rem; }
.bf-grid span { font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--muted); }
.bf-grid b { font: 500 1.1rem var(--display); }
#briefChart { width: 100%; display: block; }
.bf-note { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }

/* time bar */
#bottom { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 3; padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0.3rem 1rem; align-items: center; }
#clock { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.5rem; }
#clock b { font: 500 1.6rem/1 var(--display); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
#clock span { font: 0.78rem var(--mono); color: var(--muted); }
.tl-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.15rem 1rem; font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--muted); }
.tl-head b { color: var(--paper); font-weight: 500; }
.tl-head i { display: inline-block; width: 0.9rem; height: 0.18rem; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 0.35rem; }
#timeline { width: 100%; height: 3.6rem; display: block; grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.timebar { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem; }
#hour { flex: 1; accent-color: var(--heat); height: 1.2rem; }

/* sources modal */
#sources { position: fixed; inset: 4rem 12% 3rem; z-index: 40; padding: 1.3rem 1.6rem; overflow-y: auto; box-shadow: 0 1.2rem 4rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); }
#sources h2 { font: 500 1.6rem/1.15 var(--display); margin: 0.3rem 0 0.8rem; }
#sources h3 { font: 500 1.05rem var(--display); margin: 1.1rem 0 0.4rem; }
#sources p, #sources li { max-width: 70ch; font-size: 0.95rem; }
#sources a { color: #b9c6ec; }
#sources table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem; }
#sources td, #sources th { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 0.4rem 1rem 0.4rem 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
#sources th { font: 500 0.72rem var(--mono); color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }

/* title screen */
body.intro #top, body.intro #side, body.intro #bottom, body.intro #mapBar { display: none; }
body.intro #mapCol { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 1 / -1; }
body.intro #stageWrap { border: 0; }
body.intro #northLabel, body.intro #sunLabel { display: none; }
#intro { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 50; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 40rem) 1fr; padding: 6vh 6vw; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(11, 14, 19, 0.97) 0%, rgba(11, 14, 19, 0.86) 42%, rgba(11, 14, 19, 0.1) 78%, rgba(11, 14, 19, 0) 100%); }
#intro .inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; }
#intro h1 { font: 400 clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem)/0.95 var(--display); margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
#intro .rule { width: 4rem; height: 2px; background: var(--heat); }
#intro .tagline { font: italic 400 clamp(1.4rem, 2.3vw, 2.1rem)/1.2 var(--display); color: var(--heat); margin: 0; }
#intro p.lead { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 46ch; margin: 0; color: #cfc9be; }
#intro .actions { display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
#intro .actions button { padding: 0.7rem 1.1rem; font-size: 1rem; }
#intro button:disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: progress; }
#bootStatus { font: 0.78rem var(--mono); color: var(--muted); min-height: 1rem; }
.credit { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 0.7rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.15rem; }
.credit .names b { font-weight: 500; }
.credit .meta { font: 0.78rem var(--mono); color: var(--muted); }

/* phones and narrow windows: stack everything, map first */
@media (max-width: 860px) {
  body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto auto auto auto; height: auto; overflow-y: auto; }
  #mapCol { grid-row: 2; height: 62vh; }
  #bottom { grid-row: 3; }
  #side { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 4; overflow: visible; }
  #top .brand { width: 100%; }
  #top .seg { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  #top .seg button { font-size: 0.82rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem; }
  #top .btn { font-size: 0.82rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.55rem; }
  #sources table { display: block; overflow-x: auto; }
  #fullBtn { display: none; }
  #bottom { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  #mapBar { font-size: 0.8rem; }
  #aqi { margin-left: 0; }
  #sources { inset: 0.5rem; }
  #intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 5vh 1.2rem; background: rgba(11, 14, 19, 0.88); }
  body.intro { height: 100%; overflow: hidden; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="tip" hidden></div>

<header id="top" class="panel">
  <div class="brand"><span class="eyebrow">GIS Day 2026 · Lahore</span><b>The Lahore Canyon</b></div>
  <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Area"><button data-site="walled" aria-pressed="true">Walled City</button><button data-site="dha" aria-pressed="false">DHA Phase 2</button></div>
  <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Day"><button data-day="heat" aria-pressed="true">Heat · 10 Jun 2026</button><button data-day="smog" aria-pressed="false">Smog · 10 Nov 2026</button></div>
  <button class="btn" id="tourBtn">Walkthrough</button>
  <button class="btn" id="openSources">Data sources</button>
  <button class="btn" id="fullBtn">Full screen</button>
</header>

<section id="mapCol">
  <div id="mapBar" class="panel"><span class="what" id="barWhat"></span><span class="when" id="barWhen"></span><span id="aqi" hidden></span></div>
  <main id="stageWrap">
    <canvas id="stage" aria-label="3D map of Lahore"></canvas>
    <div id="labels"></div>
    <div id="sunLabel" hidden></div>
    <div id="northLabel">N ↑</div>
    <div id="lidLabel" hidden></div>
  </main>
</section>

<aside id="side" class="panel">
  <div class="sec" id="tourBox" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="eyebrow" id="capEye"></div>
    <p id="capText"></p>
    <div class="capnav"><span id="tourCount"></span><button class="btn" id="tourPrev">Back</button><button class="btn primary" id="tourNext">Next</button><button class="btn" id="tourExit">Exit</button></div>
    <div id="yearCard" hidden>
      <canvas id="yearChart"></canvas>
      <div class="yk"><span><i style="background:#ee8a45"></i>Avg daily max air °C (ERA5)</span><span><i style="background:rgba(201,178,138,0.7);height:0.5rem"></i>PM2.5 µg/m³ (CAMS model)</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sec" id="brief" hidden>
    <div class="bf-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Building</div><div class="bf-title"></div><div class="bf-meta"></div></div><button class="btn" id="briefClose">Close</button></div>
    <div class="bf-grid" id="briefGrid"></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Hours of direct sun on each storey's walls</div>
    <canvas id="briefChart"></canvas>
    <p class="bf-note" id="briefNote"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="sec">
    <div class="eyebrow">Map shows</div>
    <div class="layers" id="layerBtns">
      <button data-layer="lst"><span>Ground heat from space</span><span class="tag meas">Measured</span></button>
      <button data-layer="sun"><span>Sun and shade now</span><span class="tag calc">Calculated</span></button>
      <button data-layer="hours"><span>Hours of sun in the day</span><span class="tag calc">Calculated</span></button>
      <button data-layer="sky"><span>Open sky (heat &amp; smog trap)</span><span class="tag calc">Calculated</span></button>
      <button data-layer="roof"><span>What if roofs were white</span><span class="tag model">Model</span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-bar" id="lgBar"></div>
    <div class="lg-ticks" id="lgTicks"></div>
    <p class="lg-note" id="lgNote"></p>
    <p id="whatStatus" hidden></p>
  </div>

  <div class="sec">
    <div class="eyebrow">Key numbers · <span id="keysSite">Walled City</span></div>
    <div id="keys"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="sec">
    <div class="eyebrow">Data sources and dates</div>
    <ul class="src-list">
      <li><b>Buildings:</b> Google Open Buildings 2.5D, 2023, 4 m (from Sentinel-2 images)</li>
      <li><b>Ground heat:</b> Landsat 8, 7 Jun 2026 10:35 am, 30 m · MODIS Aqua, 10 Jun 2026, 1 km</li>
      <li><b>Air temperature, sunshine, wind, mixing height:</b> ERA5 (ECMWF), hourly, Nov 2025 – Nov 2026</li>
      <li><b>PM2.5 smog:</b> CAMS (Copernicus) model, hourly, Nov 2025 – Nov 2026 · not a ground station</li>
      <li><b>Sun position:</b> calculated for Lahore for each hour</li>
      <li><b>Place names:</b> OpenStreetMap</li>
    </ul>
    <button class="btn" id="openSources2">All details and links</button>
  </div>
</aside>

<section id="bottom" class="panel">
  <div id="clock"><b id="hourLabel">15:00</b><span id="dayLabel">10 Jun 2026 · Lahore time</span></div>
  <div class="tl-head" id="tlHead"></div>
  <canvas id="timeline" aria-label="Hourly chart for the day"></canvas>
  <div class="timebar"><button class="btn" id="play" aria-pressed="false">▶ Play the day</button><label for="hour" class="eyebrow">Hour</label><input type="range" id="hour" min="0" max="23" step="1" value="15"></div>
</section>

<section id="sources" class="panel" hidden>
  <div class="bf-head"><div class="eyebrow">Data sources and method</div><button class="btn" id="sourcesClose">Close</button></div>
  <h2>Where every number comes from</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>What</th><th>Source</th><th>Date / period</th><th>Type</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Building footprints and heights</td><td>Google Open Buildings 2.5D Temporal, made by Google Research with AI from Sentinel-2 images. <a href="https://sites.research.google/gr/open-buildings/temporal/">Dataset</a></td><td>2023 layer, 4 m grid</td><td><span class="tag meas">Satellite-derived</span></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Ground surface temperature and green cover</td><td>Landsat 8 Collection 2 Level-2 (USGS/NASA), scene LC08_L2SP_149038_20260607, via Microsoft Planetary Computer. <a href="https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/dataset/landsat-c2-l2">Dataset</a></td><td>7 Jun 2026, 10:35 am, 30 m pixels</td><td><span class="tag meas">Measured</span></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Ground surface temperature, afternoon and night</td><td>MODIS Aqua MYD11A1 v061 (NASA), via Microsoft Planetary Computer. <a href="https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/dataset/modis-11A1-061">Dataset</a></td><td>10 Jun 2026, 2:48 pm and 4:30 am, 1 km pixels</td><td><span class="tag meas">Measured</span></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Air temperature, humidity, sunshine, wind, mixing height</td><td>ERA5 reanalysis (ECMWF), via Open-Meteo. <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/historical-weather-api">API</a></td><td>Hourly, 1 Nov 2025 – 10 Nov 2026</td><td><span class="tag meas">Weather record</span></td></tr>
      <tr><td>PM2.5, PM10, NO₂ (smog)</td><td>CAMS global air-quality model (Copernicus), via Open-Meteo. <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/air-quality-api">API</a></td><td>Hourly, 1 Nov 2025 – 13 Nov 2026</td><td><span class="tag model">Model, not a station</span></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Sun position, sun/shade, hours of sun, open sky</td><td>Calculated in this app from the sun's position for Lahore and the building heights above</td><td>10 Jun and 10 Nov 2026, every hour</td><td><span class="tag calc">Calculated</span></td></tr>
      <tr><td>White-roof estimate</td><td>Surface energy-balance model in this app, checked against Landsat (morning) and MODIS (night)</td><td>10 Jun 2026</td><td><span class="tag model">Model</span></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Place names</td><td>© OpenStreetMap contributors. <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">Licence</a></td><td>2026</td><td></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h3>Study areas</h3>
  <p>Two squares of 1.2 × 1.2 km: the Walled City (Androon Shehr) centred near Rang Mahal, 31.581° N 74.318° E, and DHA Phase 2, 31.473° N 74.405° E. Weather and PM2.5 are for one point in the Walled City and apply to both squares.</p>
  <h3>What is measured and what is not</h3>
  <p>Every temperature in degrees comes from a satellite or the ERA5 weather record. Landsat does not give one temperature for Lahore: it measures every 30 m pixel. "Typical" is the middle value of the 1,681 pixels in our square, and "hottest spot" is the highest pixel. No satellite can measure a single wall, so walls take the value of the pixel above them.</p>
  <p>Sun and shade, hours of sun and open sky are calculated from the building heights and the sun's position. The only model estimate is the white-roof "what if"; it is always marked "Model". PM2.5 comes from the CAMS model, not a ground monitor.</p>
  <h3>Limits</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Building heights are AI estimates from satellite images, not surveyed. Lanes narrower than about 4 m are not captured.</li>
    <li>Landsat (7 June) and MODIS (10 June) read differently: MODIS averages 1 km and reads cooler. Both are shown as they were measured.</li>
    <li>Building heights on the map are stretched 1.5× so they are easier to see.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Credits</h3>
  <p>Developed by <b>Muhammad Mehdi</b> &amp; <b>Hussain Ahmad</b>, BS Geography, 7th Semester (Morning), for GIS Day 2026, Lahore.</p>
</section>

<section id="intro">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">GIS Day 2026 · 18 November · Lahore</div>
    <h1>The Lahore Canyon</h1>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <p class="tagline">Heat has an address. GIS finds it.</p>
    <p class="lead">A 3D map of every building in Lahore's Walled City and DHA, built from open satellite data: measured ground heat, the sun hour by hour on 10 June 2026, and the smog night of 10 November 2026.</p>
    <div class="actions"><button id="startTour" class="btn primary" disabled>Watch the walkthrough</button><button id="startMap" class="btn" disabled>Go straight to the map</button></div>
    <div id="bootStatus">Loading…</div>
    <div class="credit"><span class="names">Developed by <b>Muhammad Mehdi</b> &amp; <b>Hussain Ahmad</b></span><span class="meta">BS Geography · 7th Semester (Morning) · GIS: Powering Purpose and Innovation</span></div>
  </div>
  <div></div>
</section>

